    "noir_image_with_text_JhTpgt": {
      "type": "noir-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_K9A9MJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Modern Rituals",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_NY9YBM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In a world of constant doing, DAIVA Drishti™ focuses on how you feel through the day. <br/>Not just what you use — but why you use it. <br/><br/>A fragrance that helps you slow down or shift your mood. <br/>A candle that feels like a reset after a long, overwhelming day. <br/>A small moment that brings you back to yourself, without effort. <br/><br/>Every product is created with intention — where scent, words, and design come together to support how you want to feel. <br/><br/>Because sometimes, the smallest things can change the way your entire day unfolds.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_K9A9MJ",
        "text_NY9YBM"
