    "noir_image_with_text_6iVfk6": {
      "type": "noir-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_YM8WL9": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DAIVA Drishti™ Foundation",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_wQqfhq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At its core, DAIVA Drishti™ is built on the belief that abundance becomes meaningful when it is shared.<br/><br/>A portion of every sale supports initiatives that bring care, dignity, healing, and opportunity to those who need it most.<br/><br/>Our current efforts include supporting St. Catherine’s Home, an orphanage in Andheri West, Mumbai, and Karma Foundation, Pune, an organization dedicated to rescuing, treating, rehabilitating, and caring for stray animals through its advanced veterinary facilities and welfare programs.<br/><br/>As the DAIVA Drishti™ Foundation grows, we aspire to expand our impact across education, healthcare, animal welfare, and community development.<br/><br/>For those who wish to contribute directly, links to the organizations we currently support can be found below.<br/><br/>St Catherine’s Home - <br/><a href=\"https://stcatherineshome.org/donate/ \" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://stcatherineshome.org/donate/ \">https://stcatherineshome.org/donate/ </a><br/><br/>Karma Foundation - <br/><a href=\"https://www.karmafoundation.ngo/DonateNow.aspx?utm_source=daiva_drishti&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.karmafoundation.ngo/DonateNow.aspx?utm_source=daiva_drishti&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign\">https://www.karmafoundation.ngo/DonateNow.aspx?utm_source=daiva_drishti&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign</a><br/><br/>Because true abundance is shared.<br/><br/>PS – Images associated with St. Catherine’s Home are AI-generated and used solely for illustrative purposes, and do not depict the actual children of the organization. Images associated with Karma Foundation have been shared with us by the organization and feature real animals, volunteers, and facilities connected to their work.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
